ience the reason why patreon benefits  me is because it allows me to free up my  time from my corporate job to focus more  on the channel eventually I want to try  to switch to two videos per week and  only relying on YouTube revenue is  simply not a strategic choice since I'm  only one guy and my content isn't  exactly the type you can hammer out in  one day revenue also tends to fluctuate  so it's not something you should put all  your cards on I'm not looking to become  a rich celebrity youtuber guy or  anything that's just  for me but as long as I can pay my bills  go on a hike now and again and continue  to make cool videos for you all I'm a  happy camper  if you decide to donate I don't know  what else to say but thank you and of  course thank you all for watching this  video and sitting through this little  ramble at the end next week you'll be in  for a real treat since I will be  collaborating with my friend and fellow  youtuber who is none other than the one  and only masked Nintendo bandit I hope  you look forward to seeing what we have  in store for you as always if you  haven't already consider leaving a like  subscribing to the channel and become  lost in the maze with me until the next  video this is dawn signing off and have  a good one

